// The School on the crown: its ground, its shape against the sky, its front doors and a mark. The
// doors (data/doors.json `school_door`, in the `school_door` slot) are bolted from inside: the way
// in is the stair up out of the Burial into the boiler room, where the key on the caretaker's bin
// opens them from this side after, the shortcut down to the Bellfield (DUNGEONS.md 3.6).
id      school
box     60x44
anchor  centre
face    s
gates   s30, w22, e22
slots   school_door 29 25
grid
